  end
  VOY["Voyage AI<br/>embed and rerank"]
  LLM["OpenAI API<br/>or compatible gateway"]
  UI["Agent UI<br/>React chat"]
  API["Agent API<br/>POST /research, poll"]
  S3 -.->|ObjectCreated| LAM
  S3 -.->|webhook| TAPI
  LAM -->|start_workflow| IW
